WEBVTT

00:41:27.495 --> 00:41:31.005
The first doctor's appointments
that she went to, I wasn't there,

00:41:31.029 --> 00:41:32.476
and I was so angry.

00:41:32.500 --> 00:41:36.601
I was like, "This is my job.
This is my person. This is my love.

00:41:36.625 --> 00:41:39.580
I need to be next to her through this."

00:41:39.604 --> 00:41:42.358
And it was harrowing.
It wasn't fun. You know?

00:41:42.382 --> 00:41:44.117
I mean, we had an amazing few months

00:41:44.141 --> 00:41:46.131
where we really got to actually have fun,

00:41:46.155 --> 00:41:49.121
because we were so thrilled
that we got to finally be together,

00:41:49.145 --> 00:41:51.253
but it was horrible, it was dreadful.

00:41:51.277 --> 00:41:52.860
Cancer's dreadful.

00:41:52.884 --> 00:41:54.999
CA: When she left, did you feel --

00:41:55.023 --> 00:41:57.708
I don't want to over-romanticize it,

00:41:57.732 --> 00:42:00.907
but is there a sense
that she left in peace